import Layout from "@/components/common/Layout";

export default function Technology() {
    return(
        <Layout>
        <div>
            <h1>Technology</h1>
            <p>
                Our Technology: Building the Future of Plastic Recycling
At Penaca, we are setting out to redefine how plastic recycling is done in India. Our vision is to create a scientifically driven, technology-powered recycling system that delivers high-quality recycled materials while minimizing environmental impact. Though we are at the beginning of our journey, our mission is clear — to make recycled plastics as reliable and high-performing as virgin materials.

Aiming for Breakthrough Cleaning Technology
We aim to develop a proprietary hot wash process capable of removing surface contaminants from post-consumer plastic waste with exceptional efficiency. This includes eliminating oils, adhesives, inks, labels, and other residues that commonly affect the purity and performance of recycled materials.
By leveraging advanced chemistry and precision temperature control, our system will loosen contaminants without damaging the base polymer, producing super-clean plastic flakes ready for high-end reuse. Our goal is to make this process effective for both rigid and flexible plastics, including FMCG packaging, household containers, and industrial components.

Scientific and Controlled Recycling
Penaca’s future recycling lines will integrate automated color sorting and intelligent blending algorithms to ensure consistent color and quality across every batch.
We plan to use state-of-the-art extruders that enable gentle melting, fine filtration, and reduced volatile emissions, resulting in recycled resins that are durable, safe, and application-ready for diverse industries.

Targeting Odor-Free, Food-Grade Resins
Our research roadmap includes the development of a USFDA-compliant deodorization system designed to remove even the most persistent organic compounds from recycled plastics. This innovation will make Penaca’s resins suitable for food-contact and sensitive packaging applications, aligning with international quality benchmarks.

Sustainable and Responsible Systems
Sustainability will be central to our operations. Penaca aims to establish an in-house water recycling and management system to reduce ground water consumption and ensure closed-loop recycling with minimal environmental footprint.
Our approach will be guided by principles of being:
Traceable: Every recycled batch will have a transparent production history.


Circular: Every product designed to re-enter the recycling loop.


Ethical: Every process ensuring fair, safe, and responsible practices.



The Penaca Promise
While our technology is in development, our commitment to innovation, quality, and sustainability is unwavering. We are building the foundation for a new standard in recycling — one where clean, consistent, and circular materials drive a greener future.

            </p>
        </div>
        </Layout>
    )
}